+### 1.4 Phase 4.2.4.3 & Phase 4.2.4.4 Isolated Bootstrap, Clean Migration Execution & Dual-Path Proof
+- **Strict Separation of Bootstrap and Migration Runner Identities (Requirement 1)**:
+  - `bootstrapAdminConn`: Authenticated independently as `supabase_admin` (`session_user = supabase_admin`, `rolsuper = true`).
+  - `runnerClient`: Authenticated independently as `postgres` (`session_user = postgres`, `current_user = postgres`, `rolsuper = false`, `rolcreatedb = true`, `rolcreaterole = true`, `rolcanlogin = true`).
+  - Proved identity and role privileges live within both connections using PostgreSQL system catalogs.
+- **Disposable PostgreSQL 16 Cluster Safeguards (Requirement 2)**:
